{"id":"n4884f97328","headline":"India, France overhaul double tax pact. Check key updates on dividend income, share sale gains - BusinessToday","summary":"India and France have overhauled their double tax agreement, updating rules on dividend income and share sale gains. Fees for technical services have been aligned with the India-US treaty, and the permanent establishment scope expanded.","why":"Double tax treaties determine how cross-border dividends, capital gains and service income are taxed. Changes affect foreign investors and multinational firms operating between the two countries.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/india/story/india-france-overhaul-double-tax-pact-check-key-updates-on-dividend-income-share-sale-gains-517581-2026-02-23"},"sources":[{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/india/story/india-france-overhaul-double-tax-pact-check-key-updates-on-dividend-income-share-sale-gains-517581-2026-02-23"}],"published_at":"2026-02-23T11:08:41Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T19:26:54Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"f992ad205fc45854","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T19:26:54Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-02-23T11:08:41Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-02-23T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-7202373.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"niki_emmert","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pix